WEBVTT

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.320
Attention all shoppers in the flea market...

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.670
...all shoppers in the flea market!

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:17.380
Café Mew Mew opened a special stand here today.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:18.490
That’s right!

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:20.610
We have cakes and special espresso...

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:22.220
...as well as waffles!

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.400
There’s lots of sweet treats being served.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.330
Come right over now!

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:28.960
Come right over!

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:31.170
Anyone at all would be great.

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:34.510
By the way Bu-Ling,
where is Zakuro-san?

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:35.980
She's working.

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:37.280
And Retasu?

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:39.360
She called to say that she’ll be late.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:41.180
And Shirogane?

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.310
He won’t be of any help even if he shows up.

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:46.990
In the end, it’s just us doing the work?

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:48.580
I guess...

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.510
Nope, Minto-san is over there...

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:57.260
After a hard day’s work, Akasaka-san’s
tea taste exceptionally good.

00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:58.710
Just a second, Minto!

00:00:58.710 --> 00:00:59.800
Yes?

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:03.590
Today’s the charity drive,
you should at least help out a bit!

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:08.420
Ah, can’t you see? I’m trying my best to collect as much contributions as possible.

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:11.880
What do you think about the item I’m donating?

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:13.050
Huh?

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:16.480
This is?

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.150
An old cabinet.

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:20.740
It’s from the Romanoff Dynasty.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:23.320
Looks like an antique.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:25.310
How much are you selling it for?

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:29.420
Well, since it’s for charity, it’ll be cheap...

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:35.330
There are 1,2,3... 7 zeros... that means...

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:37.250
1 million yen!

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:38.460
It’s 10 million yen.

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:39.990
What?! 10 million yen?!!

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:44.510
Ah, anyone who know its value will want to buy it.

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:48.890
It’s gonna sell like hot cakes.
Should I have brought extras?

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:50.350
Now now, back to work!

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:51.310
Okay.

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:52.390
I’m speechless.

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:54.170
Hey everyone!

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:57.060
So sorry I’m late!

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:58.360
Retasu?

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:00.050
What’s with the big bag?

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:02.990
Don’t rush yourself, it’s dangerous.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.530
Retasu, are you okay?

00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:10.560
Did you hurt yourself?

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:16.590
Sorry I’m late!

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:27.720
Wahhh~! They’re so cute...

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:29.460
Bu-Ling wants one!

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:30.510
Go ahead.

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:32.730
Thank you so much!

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:36.190
Quite a lot you’ve got here.
Made them all yourself?

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:40.390
Yes. I make them in my spare time.
It accumulated over time.

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:44.070
Mother said I can give them away.

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:46.660
How much do you intend
to sell them for?

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:48.670
Oh...

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:55.940
Are you sure it’s ok to sell them at 100 yen each?

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.940
I mean, you did such a nice job as
well as paying for the materials.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:03.410
If someone really wanted them,
I’d even give it away for free.

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.560
Ehh, Retasu you’re too humble!

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.580
Retasu...!

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:11.810
Let’s have a contest,
to see who sells out first!

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:13.890
Minto-oneechan doesn’t seem to be joking.

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:17.350
Contest? Does that mean Minto
is selling something as well?

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:19.110
It’s better if you don’t know...

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:20.170
Ichigo...

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:22.390
Aoyama-kun.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:27.150
Aoyama-oniichan has also showed up. I bet
you two arranged a secret meeting here.

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:28.100
Bu-Ling!

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:29.400
Good afternoon.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:31.190
You came!

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:35.230
We’re going to help the steering
committee promote recycling.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:37.220
Ehh, that’s great, Aoyama-kun!

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.630
Those are very cute plushies.

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:41.380
Aren’t they? Retasu made them.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:43.750
Is that so? They’re well made.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.170
Thank you very much.

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:46.880
They’re so cute!!

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:48.160
Is it okay if we take a look?

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:50.180
Welcome!

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:51.680
Are you sure it’s 100 yen?

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:52.810
Yep!

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:54.100
Can I have this?

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.100
Me too.

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:56.670
Come back again.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.940
They’re selling...
isn’t that great, Retasu?

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:01.900
Mama... cute dolls!

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:04.280
Yes they are, can we have 2?

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:06.680
Two, that will be 200 yen.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.890
Look, they’re selling plushies.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.270
Oh my goodness.

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:12.770
It’s getting a little out of control!

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.620
What shall we do?

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.690
Wow this is super cute!

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:17.980
Hey, I found that first!

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:18.740
Masha!

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:21.150
I’m sorry but that’s not for sale!

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.410
Well, if there’s nothing else I’m leaving.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.850
Akasaka-san, that’s not fair!

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:30.300
Alright, everyone! Please form a line!

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:31.520
Now then, one per person,

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:34.330
please get your change ready so we don’t have to count out change!

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:36.710
Minto, you’re amazing!

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:37.850
Yea she is.

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:42.740
Okay everyone, please take a look
here as you’re passing through.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.620
So cute...

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:50.220
Ladies and gentlemen... Today, I’ll
 perform the No.1 popular stunt!

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:53.620
Bu-Ling, come down here this instant...

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:54.580
It’s called “Ball Riding”!

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:57.830
What’s all this fuss about?

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:59.190
Thank you very much.

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:01.080
Shirogane!

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:03.190
The toys are getting popular!

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:08.120
Good afternoon.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.670
Same here.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:12.220
Ichigo, I should get started now.

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:13.590
Oh really?

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:15.080
Keep up the hard work...

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:18.930
Aoyama-kun...

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:20.710
Ichigo-san, please help...

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:22.420
Ahh sorry Retasu.

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:28.990
It finally calmed down...

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:30.850
It seemed like a storm.

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:33.280
Bu-Ling has reached her limit.

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:35.060
I told you to get down from there!

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:39.370
Ehh, this looks good.

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:40.580
I-Is that so?

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:42.290
Yup, it’s well made.

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:43.360
Thank you very much.

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:45.320
Excuse me...

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:48.280
Have all the items been sold out?

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:49.760
Yep.

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:52.240
Here, this is the last one.

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:59.600
Oh good! I saw people holding very cute dolls in the area and wanted one myself.

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:03.350
Isn’t this good Retasu? Your hard work
has brought much joy to others.

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:03.980
Yes!

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:05.770
You made this yourself?

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:06.680
Y-Yes.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:09.130
This is really cute.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.350
T-Thank you.

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:15.360
Are you, by any chance, Uemura Ayano-san?

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:16.820
Yes in fact...

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:17.950
I knew it!

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:19.410
You know this person?

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:23.270
I saw her in a magazine once. She’s very
famous in the world of doll making.

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:26.670
I love Ayano-san’s dolls.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:27.280
Thanks.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:31.880
Ah Retasu, you’re amazing,
to be praised by such a person.

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:33.240
Thank you very much.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:36.640
Looks like it’s a doll
made with love.

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:38.850
Oh... by the way,
if you’re interested...

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:39.870
Here...

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:44.140
It’s my workshop,
feel free to drop by.

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:45.420
I’ll be waiting.

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:51.150
I can’t believe this!

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:53.530
Isn’t this great?! You must be happy.

00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:00.690
Is that so? That’ll be nice.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:04.080
I like your dolls very much too.

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:08.040
I’m going to brag in school tomorrow
that I have a wonderful sister!

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.380
That’s not true.

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:09.870
But...

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:14.630
Uri, what matters most is making
people around you happy...

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:18.290
Yep, I have also told that
to my students...

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:21.520
If you can give someone joy, then do so.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:22.250
I see.

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:33.730
It was amazing,
we sold out in no time!

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.030
Oh, here it is.

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:36.570
What? Where?

00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:42.690
Barely 18 years old, popular doll maker Ayano Uemura talks about her methods.

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:46.040
She’s indeed amazing.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:49.580
Retasu is very talented...
to be praised by such a person.

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:50.710
Isn’t it so?

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:51.920
By the way, where is she?

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:55.780
She went to Ayano sensei’s workshop.

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.810
All of them look cute.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:04.710
Thank you.

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:09.490
Oh... my doll, you’re displaying it.

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:12.840
Oh yes, I kinda got attached to it.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:17.110
I’m honored that my doll is being showcased with Ayano sensei’s works.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:21.310
Oh... Why don’t we make
a doll together?

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:22.520
Eh?

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:26.490
There’s going to be a new dolls exhibition soon.

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:28.480
It would be nice
if you participated in it.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:32.180
But for me to join such an exhibition...

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:36.960
Don’t worry. Your works will definitely be in the limelight...

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:40.180
You’ve done so many already.
How about we make one together?

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:42.200
But wouldn’t I be disturbing you?

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:48.500
Two heads are better than one...
besides, it’s more fun to work together.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.890
I guess so.

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:51.900
Let’s work hard together.

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.470
Thanks for the offer!

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:57.050
Sorry for being late.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.810
Retasu, how was it?

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:04.230
Ayano-san proposed a joint display in the next exhibition.

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:06.160
Wow that’s great!

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:09.370
This will be Retasu-oneechan’s debut
in the world of doll making.

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:11.460
It’s not like that...

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:13.240
What’s the commotion about?

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:15.700
Shirogane-san...

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:19.170
I’m terribly sorry for being late.

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:22.660
Don’t worry about it. Just concentrate
on making your dolls.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:24.930
Yes!

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:31.560
Thanks for the hard work.
Let’s continue tomorrow.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:35.570
Not at all, Ayano-san
taught me so much.

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:38.990
It was your own talent. You created
such an impressive doll.

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:42.200
Is it completed?

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.550
Wuah... it’s so cute!

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:46.660
The exhibition’s tomorrow right?

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:51.830
She’s really talented.
She’ll probably surpass me.

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:54.030
If that’s true, it’ll be terrible.

00:10:55.100 --> 00:11:03.320
I haven’t come up with much, while
your designs are fresh and original.

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:04.570
Ayano-san...

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:08.140
Please don’t take it to heart. Thank you.

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:09.780
Ayano-san?

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:13.450
I’ll see you later. I’ll hand it in for you.

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:14.610
But...

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:18.120
It’ll be fine, since I’ve sent in your entry form.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:20.800
I can just bring it with me tomorrow.

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:24.180
Alright. Thanks for the trouble.

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:29.180
You’ve worked hard Retasu.

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:31.010
It’s been fun...

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:34.150
...to be able to make the doll with Ayano-san, I’m content.

00:11:39.310 --> 00:11:42.070
I’m looking forward to
tomorrow’s exhibition.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:47.790
Now, we’ll get to see them at the exhibition.

00:11:57.370 --> 00:11:58.870
I’m getting very nervous.

00:11:58.870 --> 00:11:59.990
Don’t worry.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.800
They all look so cute.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:12.010
Where is the doll that Retasu made?

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:13.120
Ayano-san...

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:15.930
Over there!

00:12:15.930 --> 00:12:17.290
Let’s take a look.

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:19.310
That’s cute.

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:21.200
Ayano-sensei is as amazing as ever.

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:22.360
Everyone looks so good!

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:24.160
Please excuse us a little.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:26.760
Next, please.

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:28.360
Thank you very much.

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:29.830
Ayano-san!

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:31.770
Ayano-oneechan.

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:33.530
Excuse me...

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:34.790
Yes please?

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:38.650
I found it! 
The doll that Retasu-oneechan made!

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:42.320
Created by Uemura Ayano?

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:45.280
Isn’t this Retasu’s doll?

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:47.740
Here you go!

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:51.220
Uhm... Ayano-san, is there a mistake on this placard?

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:52.200
Hands off!

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:56.170
This is my work... can you please not touch it?

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:57.640
Ayano-san...

00:12:57.640 --> 00:12:59.130
Hey, what are you talking about?

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:01.270
Do you know what you’re saying?

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:04.610
This is 200% Retasu-oneechan’s work!

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.400
Don’t talk to me as though we’re close friends.

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:11.560
I get it now... that’s why you befriended
Retasu in the first place.

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:16.520
W-What are you talking about?
I don’t even know this girl.

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:18.700
Are you sure?

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:19.660
That’s mean!

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:21.530
We should be the ones feeling cheated!

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:24.210
I’m not tolerating these accusations with no proof.

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.990
This is my exhibition.
Please leave the premises now.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:29.140
Yeah, leave the premises now...

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:30.220
Can someone call the security?

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:31.880
Don’t worry, Ayano sensei.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:33.010
All lies!

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:34.550
I’m not telling any lie!

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:35.760
Yeah!!

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:36.720
What happened?

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:43.920
Uemura sensei is our idol. To say that
she stole your work is impossible.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.610
Yes indeed.

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.890
Sensei, we trust you...

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:49.570
Hey you.

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:52.220
Bu-Ling did not deceive anyone!

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:54.350
Stop there!

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:54.930
Ichigo-san!

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.830
I’ll never forgive you!

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.480
Who can’t you forgive?

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:02.000
Shirogane-san, Akasaka-san...

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:06.210
Out of my way! That two-bit doll maker
needs to be taught a lesson!

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:07.130
Leave it.

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:09.200
It’s none of your concern, so don’t get involved!

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:11.660
It doesn’t concern you either!

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:13.090
Eh?

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:17.690
This is a conflict between her and Retasu.
Let them solve it on their own.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.650
Alien. Alien!

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:33.250
What?

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:34.200
At a time like this?!

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:35.660
Here, over here!

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:38.990
Ayano-san!

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:40.660
Hiya, Ichigo!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:43.320
Quiche what are you trying to do?
There’s no Mew Aqua here.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:46.980
I just thought I could cause some havoc here.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:49.840
FUSION!!

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:58.910
Tokyo Mew Mew, away!

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:06.900
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:11.480
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:15.200
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:20.670
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:26.380
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-ES!

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:35.800
Let’s do it now!

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:38.290
(Dolls, go!)

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:39.330
Oh, no!

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:49.440
Now everyone, what’s the next attack?

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:50.550
That’s all!

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.900
This Chimera Anima has only one ability.

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:56.010
That’s why our attack has ended.

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:57.360
Serious?

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:58.700
Unbelievable.

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:00.660
No matter how you look at it,
it’s too weak.

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:01.910
Don’t underestimate it.

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:04.840
Let’s finish this at one go!

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:18.370
Eh?

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:35.140
Reborn Strawberry... Eh?

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:35.720
Reborn Strawberry... Eh?

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:39.370
What is this?

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:42.920
This is not good.

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:44.790
Oh no!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.860
You liar!!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.290
Hahaha...

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:53.070
You have underestimated us.
So... what shall we do next?

00:16:54.500 --> 00:17:00.870
I am not going to forgive you for
using all these precious dolls...

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:03.930
Heh, you have a scary face.

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:07.330
...since you can’t move, I’m going to
make sure you’ll experience pain.

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:09.520
LettasTanets!

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:12.800
Reborn... Lettuce RUSH!!

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:16.760
Nya!

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:20.300
That’s incredible, Mew Lettuce!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:23.600
I can use Lettuce Rush Attack as
long as my fingers can move.

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:25.270
Mew Strawberry, it’s time!

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:45.770
Reborn... Strawberry SURPRISE!!

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:52.710
(Mew Mew... remember this... arghhh!)

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:57.690
Ayano-san...

00:17:57.690 --> 00:17:59.370
Ayano-san?

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:03.100
Ayano-san!

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:05.620
I...

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:07.500
It’s okay now.

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:09.270
Go away.

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:11.980
What is this? Are you trying to make fun of me?

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.150
Ayano-san...

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:20.050
I can’t do it,
no matter how hard I try...

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:26.600
Day after day, I tried my best to design the dolls...

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:31.520
but couldn’t come up
with any new designs.

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:35.780
I was at my wits end.

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:42.890
When I thought of giving up,
I saw your dolls...

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:47.210
I envied your creativity.

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:52.810
I had no choice.

00:18:54.920 --> 00:19:00.500
Ayano-san, I was very happy to have you praise my dolls.

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:06.180
That’s why I worked hard to make the
doll, to make more people happy.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:11.970
To spread happiness through our
work, that’s what’s important...

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:13.220
We?

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:15.340
Yes, we...

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:18.520
It’s not important who made the doll.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:22.030
It’s more important that more people enjoy the dolls.

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:26.710
Furthermore, making the dolls together was a lot of fun.

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:38.800
Did Ayano-san have fun as well?

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:45.000
Sorry...

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:48.560
Let’s do it again next time, Ayano-san!

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:55.810
Retasu...

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:57.650
This is her strength.

00:19:57.650 --> 00:19:59.590
Indeed, normal people can’t do that.

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:00.980
What is it?

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:03.030
Retasu realized it from the start.

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:04.070
Eh?

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:08.500
But she still believes in her.
It’s amazing...

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:12.940
Retasu...

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:27.230
Ah... Zakura-oneesama...

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:29.570
Why are you always so serious?

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:32.950
I’ve always hoped for a sister like you.

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:34.150
Aren’t you being a little too persistent?

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:37.050
Ichigo, I don’t need to hear that from you.

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:41.300
Ah... oneesama smiled at me...

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:43.790
She wasn’t smiling at you, she’s smiling
at the little girl over there.

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:46.810
Next: “Don’t cry, lonely little Zakuro.”

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:49.430
Who in the world is that kid,
Zakuro-oneesama??
